@startuml
title Pokémon - Quiz & Answer Flow

actor User
participant "PokemonQuizController" as API
participant "QuizService" as Service
participant "PokeAPI" as External

== User gets quiz ==

User -> API : GET /trashcan/pokemon/quiz
API -> Service : GetPokemonTypeQuizAsync()
Service -> External : GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon/{id}
External --> Service : JSON (name, types)
Service -> Service : Build question + options\nEncode questionId
Service --> API : Quiz
API --> User : Quiz in JSON (w/ options, questionId)

== User submits answer ==

User -> API : POST /trashcan/pokemon/check-answer\n{ answer, questionId }
API -> API : Decode questionId\nExtract correct answer
API -> API : Compare answer vs correctAnswer
API --> User : Result (Correct / Wrong)

@enduml